      },
      {
        title: "Treatment & Disinfection",
        desc: "Application of chosen solutions (enzymes, oxygen...) based on your needs/budget. We explain each option to you.",
      },
      {
        title: "Powerful Extraction",
        desc: "We use the most powerful equipment possible (Truck-Mount or Pro Portable for difficult access) to leave your carpets nearly dry.",
      },
    ],
    benefits: [
      "Systematic floor protection",
      "40+ products for all types of stains",
      "Truck-Mount or Pro Portable equipment",
    ],
    faq: [
      {
        q: "Is it dangerous for my wood floor?",
        a: "Not at all. We install protections and water never penetrates the carpet thanks to our powerful suction.",
